    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n4359" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀλλαγ-ή</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[ᾰγ]</span><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">, ἡ
			</span>(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀλλάσσω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>change</i>, <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Ag.</u>
				482
			</span></i>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀλλαγᾷ βίου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>OT</u>
					1206
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">η κäτὰ τόπον ἀ</span>.
				<i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Spir.</u>
				485a22
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. θεῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					2.166d
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>exchange, barter, buying and selling</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>R.</u>
				371b
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>EN</u>
				1133a19
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Pol.</u>
				1257a13
			</span></i>; pl., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διὰ τὰς ἀ</span>. <i>for
				purposes of exchange</i>, ib.<i><span class="en">
				1280a35
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>agio</i>, whether premium or discount, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Peripl.M.Rubr.</u>
				49
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PEleph.</u>
				14.10
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii B. C.)</span>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PTeb</u>
				99.2
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii B. C.)</span>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>BGU</u>
				1194.17
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(i B. C.)</span>, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b> later, <i>change of post-horses, stage</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Eust.
				531.21
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>POxy.</u>
				1863.5
			</span></i>, etc.</div>
